:: Fishing Pier Magnet Scrap Catch
<<effects>>
<<if $daily.fishing.pier.fisher.phase is "fishing">>
	<<fishingPierMagnetScrapCaughtFisher>>
<<else>>
	<<fishingPierMagnetScrapCaught>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Pier Magnet Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingPierMagnetScrapCaught">>
	<<fishingMagnetCatchText $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	You pry it off the magnet and stow it away. You might be able to sell it for scrap.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push($fishingMagnetScrap.type)>>
	<<run decrementMagnetLoot("fishingPier")>>
	<<unset $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "fishingPierMagnetScrapCaughtFisher">>
	<<fishingMagnetCatchText $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	You pry it off the magnet and stow it away.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push($fishingMagnetScrap.type)>>
	<<run decrementMagnetLoot("fishingPier")>>
	<<unset $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	<<if !$daily.fishing.scrapComment>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.scrapComment to true>>
		<br><br>
		<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_pier_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
		The <<personsimple>> nods at what you've pulled up. "That could be worth something, I'd check by the scrapyard on your way back to town."
	<<else>>
		You might be able to sell it for scrap.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>


:: Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Cash Register
<<effects>>
The line goes taut and won't come up. Something is caught on the magnet.
<br><br>

<<link [[Lean back and haul|Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Cash Register Haul]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 600 1200>>


:: Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Cash Register Haul
<<effects>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	An old cash register <span class="green">comes up out of the water</span>, drawer stuck half-open. You pry it wider and find some coins inside, <span class="green">£40</span> worth. You haul it onto the boards to sell for scrap later.
	<<money 4000 "fishing">>
	<<set $scrapInventory.push("cashRegister")>>
	<<set $fishing.singleCatch.cashRegister to true>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">Whatever it is, it won't budge.</span> Your rope goes slack as the object slips free from the magnet.<<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Chain Length
<<effects>>
The line goes taut and won't come up. Something is caught on the magnet.
<br><br>

<<link [[Lean back and haul|Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Chain Length Haul]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 300 800>>


:: Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Chain Length Haul
<<effects>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	A length of old chain <span class="green">breaks the surface</span>, links gone orange with rust. You haul it up and coil it on the boards. It's probably worth something at the scrapyard.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push("chainLength")>>
	<<set $fishing.singleCatch.chainLength to true>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">Whatever it is, it won't budge.</span> Your rope goes slack as the object slips free from the magnet.<<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


