<<effects>>
The line goes taut and won't come up. Something is caught on the magnet.
<br><br>

<<link [[Lean back and haul|Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Shopping Trolley Haul]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 700 1300>>


:: Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Shopping Trolley Haul
<<effects>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	A supermarket trolley <span class="green">scrapes up over the railing</span> and drops onto the boards with a clang. Dented, one wheel missing, basket caved in. You drag it to the side to sell for scrap later.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push("shoppingTrolley")>>
	<<set $fishing.singleCatch.shoppingTrolley to true>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">Whatever it is, it won't budge.</span> Your rope goes slack as the object slips free from the magnet.<<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


