:: Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Boat Anchor Haul
<<effects>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	A barnacled boat anchor <span class="green">comes up out of the water</span>, chain trailing behind it. You drag it up onto the boards. Solid iron like that will fetch a decent price as scrap.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push("boatAnchor")>>
	<<set $fishing.singleCatch.boatAnchor to true>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">Whatever it is, it won't budge.</span> Your rope goes slack as the object slips free from the magnet.<<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>


:: Fishing Pier Magnet Pull Compass
<<effects>>
The magnet drags up something small and solid. You pry a copper compass off it, the needle still pointing north under fogged, worn glass. Old, but intact. Something like this might be worth a bit to a collector.
<<museumAntiqueStatus "antiquecoppercompass" "found">>
<<set $antiquemoney += 200>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><</link>>
